# NAME: AppStore
# AUTHOR: blackmatrix7 + Muse for Wen Ze
# REPO: https://github.com/zwz0607/rules
# UPDATED: 2026-11-27
# SOURCE: https://github.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script (rule/AppStore/AppStore.list) + scripts/appstore-extra.list
# NOTE: Upstream has only apps.apple.com + itunes.apple.com. Extras add the download/CDN domains (mzstatic.com, iosapps/osxapps.itunes.apple.com, cdn-apple.com, etc.) - without them App Store downloads do not match this list.
# USAGE (Shadowrocket): RULE-SET,https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/zwz0607/rules@main/rule/Shadowrocket/AppStore/AppStore.list,DIRECT

DOMAIN,apps.apple.com
DOMAIN,itunes.apple.com

# Curated extras (not in blackmatrix7)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mzstatic.com
DOMAIN,iosapps.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,osxapps.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appstore.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appsto.re
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdn-apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appldnld.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,secure-appldnld.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aaplimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.com.cn
